&lt;same as above&gt; indicates that the value matches the previous occurence of the macro.


Hierarchies have been optimized away during sweep. For more details and filtering options, ensure that you have compiled with the "Enable RTL Analysis Debug Mode " setting turned on under Assignments->Settings->Compiler Settings, then use the " Sweep Hints Viewer " tool in the " RTL Analyzer ".
